Description: Bound infinite-timeout tests by the representable time range
 Backport upstream c521584590af5291ca576e625525c3b16ba05c8b without the
 unrelated include cleanup. Dynamic now-plus-100000-hours expectations have
 passed the 32-bit time_t limit; the library correctly saturates at that limit.
 This changes test expectations only, not the timeout implementation.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/abseil/abseil-cpp/commit/c521584590af5291ca576e625525c3b16ba05c8b
Applied-Upstream: master, c521584590af5291ca576e625525c3b16ba05c8b
Last-Update: 2026-10-20

